## Overview

SecureDocChain is a **secure document sharing platform** — NOT a storage platform. Documents are encrypted client-side, pushed to IPFS, and only the hash + access permissions live on the blockchain. The focus is on **who can see what, when, and proving it immutably**.

Three professional verticals are served through a single platform with mode-switched UIs:
- **LegalVault** — Law firms (contracts, evidence, privileged comms)
- **ScriptSafe** — Screenwriters & Production Houses (scripts, IP proof, watermarking)
- **VaultDesk** — Businesses & Startups (NDAs, pitch decks, deal rooms)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Blockchain:** Polygon Amoy testnet for all development & testing. Production target is Polygon PoS mainnet. The existing Hardhat config already points to Amoy — we build on that.
>
> **Frontend:** Next.js 14 (App Router) — replaces the React/Vite spec in the brief.
>
> **Backend:** Node.js 20 LTS + Express 5 (TypeScript) — the key proxy & API service.

